{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:13 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:13 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:13 2026-11-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"最新消息\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b7020baeda874b6a27dea1538f6b03a/2023-07/4c2d0aa2-79b3-448b-afd5-ca0fd07d3a0b.jpeg\"/><p>俄羅斯遠東地區堪察加半島發生黎克特制6.7級地震，美國地質調查局（United States Geological Survey，USGS）初步數據顯示，地震發生於本港時間晚上9時15分06秒，震源深度188.4公里，判定為中層地震，震央位於俄羅斯堪察加半島葉利佐沃（Yelizovo）附近約62公里處。目前尚未發布海嘯警報，也未接獲確切人員傷亡或災損通報。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:40:00.360402+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":262,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T14:13:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:35:54.597201+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:33:28.182581+00:00","content_hash":"c439c2e8b07f482cd30988a710cf4ec91aaf2a10849cdd87a5c6e6fe003f72eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}